&lt;p class="MsoNoSpacing"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;"&gt;Effective March 18, 2026, Peter Gregg was appointed to the Board of Directors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNoSpacing"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInOfficersDirectorsMajorSecurityHoldersAndVotingPowersOfTheRespondentTextBlock>
